Z||000001||Raydar||09-05-2001||09:48 AM||||I had an 88 Firebird Formula. The Firebird gauges are quite a bit bigger than the Fiero. I suspect the electronics are similar. Cool idea, though. The Firebird probably had the best instrumentation of any car I've ever owned. Looked *great* at night.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||14
